{"ref":"BDB, יָלִיד","hw":"יָלִיד","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">יָלִיד</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. born</strong>, only cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלִיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:12\" href=\"/Genesis.17.12\">Gn 17:12</a> + 4 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלִידֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:14\" href=\"/Genesis.14.14\">14:14</a> + 6 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּילִדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">2 S 21:18</a>;—<em>born</em>, especially of slave <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלִיד בַּיִת</span> born in (one’s) house (opp. purchased by money) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:12\" href=\"/Genesis.17.12\">Gn 17:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:13\" href=\"/Genesis.17.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:27\" href=\"/Genesis.17.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.11\">Lv 22:11</a> (all P), cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.14\">Je 2:14</a> where denied of Israel; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלִידֵי בַיִת</span> <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:14\" href=\"/Genesis.14.14\">Gn 14:14</a>; pl. elsewhere subst. = <em>children, sons</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">יל׳ הרפה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.16\">2 S 21:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">18</a> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יל׳ הָרְפָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.4\">1 Ch 20:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יל׳ הענק</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:22\" href=\"/Numbers.13.22\">Nu 13:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:28\" href=\"/Numbers.13.28\">28</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:14\" href=\"/Joshua.15.14\">Jos 15:14</a> (all JE).","next":"BDB, מוֹלֶ֫דֶת","prev":"BDB, יִלּוֹד"}